+The latest October 14 scoped-read candidate's admission epoch to main-model dispatch took 2.16/4.16 seconds in the browser and 5.96/6.76 seconds in the CLI. Dispatch to processed first text took 0.55–0.69 seconds. Populated CLI recall took 3.26/3.75 seconds, including query embedding acquisition of 0.39/0.38 seconds. The warm browser's admission/checkpoint span took 2.36 seconds with a shared budget-account conflict. Protected delivery and current-source checks also add delay. These are separate, sometimes overlapping clocks; they cannot be summed into an invented total. Gateway routing and external-provider internal timings remain unavailable.
