+All four ordinary replies completed. Native checks passed four attributed positive facts, eight current-profile source vectors and contiguous facts/vectors through eight events. A separate repeated-capture scenario passed canonical rows, replay/body-conflict, provenance, six complete native stage usages, public recall and the original access/lock/deletion/revocation negatives; public recall took 2.71 seconds. The approved memory tool and its final answer completed after one approval and observer disconnect/reconnect, with strict facts/vectors through 11 of 11. Expired and invalid-signature SDK tokens returned `UNAUTHENTICATED` in 133/89 ms with no protected payload and unchanged data/financial inventories. The disposable database, container and private credentials were independently verified absent. These functional successes leave the subsecond target unmet; optional graph work was not qualified by this run.
